      "index": "b0H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 3376142,
      "version": 755,
      "versionNonce": 1331556562,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794028791604,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Used for repetitive kinds of tasks\n.\n\n2. Contains both calling time and\nreturning time execution path .\n\n3. Heavily uses stack also uses call\nstack .\n\n4. Creates multipkle copy of local\nvariables and parameter one copy for\neach call .\n\n5. Generally slow in speed .\n\n6. Reduces the length of call .",
      "fontSize": 21.81048864848927,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Used for repetitive kinds of tasks .\n\n2. Contains both calling time and returning time execution path .\n\n3. Heavily uses stack also uses call stack .\n\n4. Creates multipkle copy of local variables and parameter one copy for each call .\n\n5. Generally slow in speed .\n\n6. Reduces the length of call .",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
