      "versionNonce": 1381219662,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794028791604,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "It is also used for repetitive kinds of tasks .\n\nContains only calling time execution .\n\n\n\nUses stack very midly .\n\n\nCreates only one copy of local variable and parameter .\n\n\n\nFaster in speed .\n\nIncreases the length of code .",
      "fontSize": 21.81048864848927,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "It is also used for repetitive kinds of tasks .\n\nContains only calling time execution .\n\n\n\nUses stack very midly .\n\n\nCreates only one copy of local variable and parameter .\n\n\n\nFaster in speed .\n\nIncreases the length of code .",
